| `check_X` child environment | Refuses a Python spawn without `env=build_child_env(...)`, an allowlist that admits a credential or repository-context name, a `models.allowed_hosts` entry not written in its one canonical form, and an `evidence.run_date.env` that `child_env.names` does not list. | `make check` | [`child_env.names`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`models.credential_env.<adapter>`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`models.allowed_hosts.<adapter>`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evidence.run_date.env`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Python spawns only: a recipe that runs `npm` hands it make's whole environment. Defence-in-depth, not a sandbox. | [limits-and-troubleshooting.md](../guides/limits-and-troubleshooting.md) | always |
